Study the configuration given. What value does this procedure return?
int[] a = {-2, 2, 2, 4, 6};
int acc = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < a.length; i++) if (a[i] > 5) acc++;
return acc;

Evaluate the example that follows. What does this string routine return?
String s = "bxcubdea";
int acc = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++)
  if ("aeiou".indexOf(s.charAt(i)) >= 0) acc++;
return acc;

Review the following and respond. Which index pair does this scan return?
int[] a = {-1, 1, 4, 7, 11, 14, 16, 19, 20};
int i = 0, j = a.length - 1;
while (i < j) { int s = a[i] + a[j]; if (s == 11) return new int[]{i, j}; if (s < 11) i++; else j--; }
return new int[]{-1, -1};

Here is a question to solve. What does this pointer code return?
Node a = new Node(10);
Node b = new Node(35);
Node c = new Node(20);
a.next = b; b.next = c; c.next = null;
Node p = a;
while (p.next != null) p = p.next;
return p.value;

Identify the correct outcome below. Tracing this code:
int[] a = {2, 6, 9, 13, 14, 15, 20, 25, 28};
int lo = 0, hi = a.length - 1, steps = 0;
while (lo <= hi) { int mid = (lo + hi) / 2; steps++; if (a[mid] == 2) return mid; if (a[mid] < 2) lo = mid + 1; else hi = mid - 1; }
return -1;

